mapping "V2540.1" source="V2540" target="10298002" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V2540 = Swedish 5-char extension of ICD-10 V25.4 (motorcycle driver injured in traffic
        collision with railway train), adding an SNOMED CT 10298002 242090001 48084008 qualifier. Parent
        V25.4 has Athena crosswalks to SNOMED CT 438310 (Victim, motorcycle rider in vehicular AND/OR
        traffic accident, 10298002), 432510 (Driver in vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, 48084008), and
        4054296 (Motor vehicle on road in collision with vehicle running on rails, 242090001). The
        activity qualifier (sport/work/vital) has no SNOMED CT representation; it is an administrative
        dimension absent from OMOP. Targets are broader: each subsumes a clinical facet (rider role,
        driver role, collision mechanism) of the source while dropping the non-clinical activity detail.
        Moderate tier : parent crosswalk verified, but unspecified activity dimension and breadth
        mismatch (each target captures one facet, not the full event).
        """
}
